cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the article and the archived release."
title: "wildfire-bc-bilstm-pso: geospatial deep learning and SHAP-based explanation for wildfire susceptibility and exposure assessment in British Columbia"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline, derived geospatial data, and ISO 19115-2 / CSVW metadata for a
  BiLSTM-PSO wildfire susceptibility and exposure framework for British Columbia, Canada
  (2000-2024). All spatial layers use NAD83 / BC Albers (EPSG:3005) at 1500 m.
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-11"
license: MIT
